---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const contactEmail = "alexisdeveloper2722@gmail.com";

const links = [
  { href: "/", label: "Inicio" },
  { href: "/privacidad", label: "Política de privacidad" },
  { href: "/terminos", label: "Términos de uso" },
];
---

<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-white/10 bg-ink-soft/60">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="/icon-512.png" alt="" width="40" height="40" class="rounded-xl" />
        <div>
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-txt">Gana4</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-txt-muted">Cuatro en Línea</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-txt-soft">
        Contra la máquina y multijugador por WiFi local. Sin registro, sin compras, jugando desde
        tu dispositivo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-txt-muted">
        Documentos
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
        {
          links.map((link) => (
            <li>
              <a href={link.href} class="text-sm text-txt-soft transition hover:text-accent-soft">
                {link.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-txt-muted">
        Contacto
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-txt-soft">¿Dudas sobre tus datos o la app?</p>
      <a
        href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}
        class="mt-1 inline-block break-all text-sm text-accent-soft transition hover:text-cyan"
      >
        {contactEmail}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div
      class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-6 text-xs text-txt-muted sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between sm:px-6"
    >
      <p>© {year} Gana4. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
      <p>Paquete Android: com.romel.gana4</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
